{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215340","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215340","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1421534001:1":{"text":"我们来提交作品了！","source_cn":"我们来提交作品了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F414CA904F8A44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421534002:1":{"text":"就差你们了！我来看看瓦恩的作品——剑锋飒沓锐利！剑柄雕刻得古朴优美，技艺纯熟，关键是这完美的重量掌控……","source_cn":"就差你们了！我来看看瓦恩的作品——剑锋飒沓锐利！剑柄雕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B6FE962C89E370C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421534003:1":{"text":"瓦恩，看来你真的突破了你自己。","source_cn":"瓦恩，看来你真的突破了你自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FD75D135B2F62F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421534004:1":{"text":"我宣布，你和铁哥达是唯二通过淘汰赛考验的工匠。","source_cn":"我宣布，你和铁哥达是唯二通过淘汰赛考验的工匠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA2730E4E3A6B946","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421534005:1":{"text":"铁哥达？","source_cn":"铁哥达？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF93F357CF2D491E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421534006:1":{"text":"是铁须的徒弟……原来他也参加这次的锻魂大赛了。","source_cn":"是铁须的徒弟……原来他也参加这次的锻魂大赛了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x276174D652842280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421534007:1":{"text":"铁哥达和瓦恩，本届锻魂大赛的冠军将通过接下来的最终比试，在你们中产生！","source_cn":"铁哥达和瓦恩，本届锻魂大赛的冠军将通过接下来的最终比试...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CB39322563141AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421534008:1":{"text":"瓦恩？！真没想到最后的对手是你。","source_cn":"瓦恩？！真没想到最后的对手是你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71867B2D459D2516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421534009:1":{"text":"铁哥达……还有你身边这是……","source_cn":"铁哥达……还有你身边这是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFD62CE19D06A473","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421534010:1":{"text":"这是我在外认识的佣兵朋友斯拉格，他为了帮我试剑特意坐很久的船来到了深岩村……","source_cn":"这是我在外认识的佣兵朋友斯拉格，他为了帮我试剑特意坐很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x811820F14A3902E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421534011:1":{"text":"这次比赛里，师父的建议帮了我很多……","source_cn":"这次比赛里，师父的建议帮了我很多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x689E6ABDEF8BAC1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421534012:1":{"text":"但最终是为斯拉格锻造一把趁手的好武器的决心让我通过了考验！","source_cn":"但最终是为斯拉格锻造一把趁手的好武器的决心让我通过了考验！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43A5D492F644940C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421534013:1":{"text":"剑，铁哥达，好！","source_cn":"剑，铁哥达，好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B928DBF498128C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421534014:1":{"text":"最终比试……尽管来吧，我可不会怕你！","source_cn":"最终比试……尽管来吧，我可不会怕你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52F25A0E0AF5793F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421534015:1":{"text":"最终比试是对你们锻造的武器进行实战测试，将会有两名工作人员使用你们所打造的武器进行战斗，赢得这场战斗的人，他手中的武器将成为毋庸置疑的冠军之剑！","source_cn":"最终比试是对你们锻造的武器进行实战测试，将会有两名工作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB264CEC939FD7F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1421534016:1":{"text":"满满想要报名参赛！我想用瓦恩锻造的剑战斗！","source_cn":"满满想要报名参赛！我想用瓦恩锻造的剑战斗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA699168F13322AE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_inde